const changeStatus=(o,status)=>msg(async()=>{if(status==='claim')await api(`/orders/${o._id}/claim`,{method:'POST',token});else await api(`/orders/${o._id}/status`,{method:'PATCH',token,body:{status}});notify(`Order updated`)});
const feedback=async o=>{if(o.status!=='delivered'){setTarget(o);setModal('track');return}setTarget(o);setModal('feedback')};
